TEXT -32 232 Left 2 !.ac dec 50 100 100k
TEXT -32 264 Left 2 !.step param run 1 20 1
TEXT -32 296 Left 2 !.meas ac fc WHEN vdb(out)=-3
TEXT -32 344 Left 2 ;Monte Carlo: mc(x,tol) is x with a tolerance, uniform within +-tol (flat(x): +-x, gauss(x):
TEXT -32 368 Left 2 ;normal, sigma x). Each run of the .step draws anew: 20 samples of this RC low-pass,
TEXT -32 392 Left 2 ;R 1k +-5 %, C 100n +-20 %: fc = 1/(2*pi*R*C) spreads around 1.59 kHz, its .meas per run.
